欺压我南人多时的啦，这\n张翼不过是凶手之一，我最终目的还是要\n打倒汉人，夺回我们南人之地的啦。\n&南蛮兵1\n打倒汉人的啦！\n&南蛮兵2\n还我土地的啦！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[22,14,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,14,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张嶷\n果然这股积怨不是三言两语就可以了结的\n。现在只有用实力去摆平他们。\n&马忠\n单靠我们的兵力还是不够，本来我有邀请\n孟获出兵，但是他不愿意，所以我只好请\n关将军用了点特殊手段。\n&关索\n唉…到时候，你们可千万要保护我喔。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[22,65535,2,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,65535,2,65535,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘胄\n兄弟们，给这些可恶的汉人一个教训的啦\n，让他们知道我们南人厉害的啦！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1010],[]]},"end":48},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n为了保持充分战力来镇守南中，我军在这\n场战役不能有任何一个人撤退。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1010],[]]},"end":52},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑歼灭所有敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑我军任何一人死亡。\n二﹑回合数超过20。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1010]]},"end":55},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑歼灭所有敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑马忠死亡。\n二﹑回合数超过20。\n一﹑歼灭所有敌军。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑歼灭所有敌军。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n我军和友军全员生存。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":11759,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":11761,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,20,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,238,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":11866,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[3,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[188]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,20,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,16,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,20,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n关索！终于让我找到你了。\n&花鬘\n你胆子还真大，居然敢回来南中的啦。\n&关索\n这是小小的误会，你不要再生气了。\n&花鬘\n误会？你一声不响从南中跑掉是误会？\n给我看到和鲍家三小姐幽会是误会？\n甚至听说你还回去找那个星彩的啦。\n&关索\n那都是…\n&马忠\n我只知道关将军对我说过，他对花鬘姑娘\n一往情深，其他女子不过逢场作戏罢了。\n&关索\n等一下，我没…\n&张嶷\n咳，关将军，大局为重。\n&花鬘\n哼，也不知道是真的还是假的，暂时相信\n你吧。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[188,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":12408,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[8,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[189]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,238,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孟获\n刘胄你快停手，我女儿在战场里面的啦，\n难道你连我女儿也要杀？\n&刘胄\n为了我们南人的尊严的啦，这点牺牲\n算什么？\n&孟获\n去你的，老子受不了了。\n&孟获\n本来想说当个御史中丞说话要文雅点的啦\n，你这混蛋把老子给惹火了。\n&刘胄\n哼，我不服你也很久了，你这个出卖南人\n的奸贼，我要宰了你成为新的南中之王的\n啦。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[189,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":12775,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,7,13]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[190]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[88,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[190,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":12848,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,15,15]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[191]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[88,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[191,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":12921,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,18,6]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[192]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[88,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[192,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":12994,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[16,20,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[193]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,20,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,16,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n谢谢你来帮我。\n&花鬘\n哼，人家可不是为你而来的啦。\n&关索\n（这是傲娇？）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[193,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":13178,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[16,238,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[194]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,238,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[238,16,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孟获\n臭小子，若不是看在老婆和女儿的份上，\n老子早就把你大卸八块的啦。\n&关索\n大王饶命呀。\n&孟获\n要是再让老子知道你还有什么拈花惹草\n的事，老子一定砍死你的啦。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[194,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":13442,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[36,210,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[195]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[36,210,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[210,36,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n刘胄，你做这样的事情根本没有意义，\n就算打败我，你也打不过丞相的大军。\n&刘胄\n我不会像孟获那个废物那样败七次，\n我一次就可以打败诸葛亮的啦。\n&马忠\n别说大话了，你连我你都打不过，还妄想\n和丞相交手。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[195,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":13749,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[20,210,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[196]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,210,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[210,20,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n我看你真正的目的不过就是想当南中王，\n说什么抗暴都是骗人的啦。\n&刘胄\n你懂什么，像你们这种汉南混血的人，怎\n么样都不可能了解我们南中人的需求的啦\n，只有我才能让南中脱离汉人魔爪的啦。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[196,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":14041,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[22,210,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[197,1010]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[22,210,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[210,22,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘胄\n可恶的汉人，我要你们全都不得好死\n的啦。\n&张嶷\n你的心情我可以了解，但是为了大汉，\n现在我就要借你的首级一用。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":33},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[22,210,34]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"刘胄，纳命来吧！",8]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"小看我你会倒楣的啦。",9]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"唔啊！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,10]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"怎么啦？\n难道你就这点本事？",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,8]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"可、可恶！",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"你自豪的南中的作战方式还没有我熟练，\n我管辖的无当飞军可是比